      "en": "The sequence of blessings in Havdalah follows the mnemonic Yavneh or Ge-Be-Me-H: Gefen (wine), Besamim (spices), Me'orei Ha'esh (fire), and HaMavdil (the Havdalah blessing itself). There is a widespread custom that women do not drink from the Havdalah wine cup, which stems from kabbalistic considerations and midrashic traditions connected to Eve squeezing grapes, although strictly by halachic law a woman is allowed to drink it.",
